Subject: [PATCH 1/2] =?UTF-8?q?Add=20FitCheck-In=20Sync=20module=20(Health?=
 =?UTF-8?q?Kit=20=E2=86=92=20FitCheck-In=20upload=20bridge)?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Independent module under HealthMonitor/Sources/FitCheckInSync:
- Supabase email sign-in with Keychain session storage and token refresh
- HKAnchoredObjectQuery-based reads (HealthKit UUIDs for idempotent upload)
- daily/hourly statistics buckets with deterministic ids
- batched HTTPS upload with exponential-backoff retry and error display
- optional HealthKit background delivery (best effort)
- Today toolbar entry point; existing features unchanged

project.yml now declares the HealthKit entitlement and widget extension
point so 'xcodegen generate' no longer strips them, and keeps the
signing team.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
